              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kogita EJAKAIT ateker naka Lebi kapak kaŋin, adakenen asaduku naka aitutuket naka EJAKAIT, abwoenen kakonyen nuka EJAKAIT aijaanakin ŋes, aisirereŋ kokirorike, kiton lolo. ",
          "type": "text",
