            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kanuka ŋun emamei Lebi akorakinet karaida airumet koinacanake; EJAKAIT ŋes airumeteke, kwape abalar EJAKAIT Ekonideke ŋes.)",
          "type": "text",
